ened=6 approved=6) that fails on any softened key outside an approved set of six: FR-1's three plus FR-8's two (announced override of the brief's three). codex #2: T6 adopts spec v1.4's two-clause domain rule and resolved-prefix definition; M-12, M-13 (both cases), M-14 and M-18 stay, judge-error in both gates under step5. codex #3: R-4 publishes the driver script, every case's patch, and its observed output on codex-cli 0.158 [... truncated (1031 chars total)]"}]}]},"locations":[]}
{"type":"thought","data":"Auditing the TDD gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" failure plan."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe inlined plan excerpt"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is truncated. I will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" read the full file "}
{"type":"thought","data":"on disk instead. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" audit covers three "}
{"type":"thought","data":"axes: adversarial consistency,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" invariant compliance,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and spec reconciliation."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe inlined plan stops"}
{"type":"thought","data":" at v1.5, but the spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" has advanced to v1.6."}
{"type":"thought","data":" That later version "}
{"type":"thought","data":"adds a root-refuse rule"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for unenterable roots"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on both gates. I need"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to verify whether the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on-disk plan matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this newer spec."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe inlined plan omits"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the v1.6 root-refuse"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rule for unenterable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" roots and the N-1 lexical"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `..` rule. It also "}
{"type":"thought","data":"lacks the M-18 row updates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for AC-3.3 and AC-6.1."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I am checking whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the on-disk file contains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" these gaps.\n\nT1 omits the v1.6 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"N-1 rule that `..` out"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of a non-symlink directory"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is lexical parent and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not opened, and that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `.` components are "}
{"type":"thought","data":"dropped from the walk"}
{"type":"thought","data":" first."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan may be stale"}
{"type":"thought","data":" against the v1.6 spec."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will check the on-disk"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file to see if it already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" covers the v1.6 root-refuse"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and N-1 lexical `..`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rules."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's PD-4 approved"}
{"type":"thought","data":" set still includes "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the unfixed Codex M-14"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cell under M-18, which"}
{"type":"thought","data":" conflicts with v1.6's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" correction.\n\nPD-1 cites"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a T0 measurement at"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 983c2f85 showing both"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gates allow, but the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec states this cell"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is not yet measured."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This appears to be "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a spec contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than a plan "}
{"type":"thought","data":"error.\n\nThe plan correctly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" re-derived the AC-3.6"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unfixed column from"}
{"type":"thought","data":" its own measurement,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so the spec's \"not "}
{"type":"thought","data":"yet measured\" label "}
{"type":"thought","data":"is stale rather than"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a plan error.\n\nA test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" name mismatch was also"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spotted in the verified"}
{"type":"thought","data":" premises section."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nPD-2 names the test"}
