{"type":"thought","data":"prescription is accurate."}
{"type":"thought","data":" It will also search"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for additional plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" issues and check PD-2's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" three unpacking sites."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit will verify"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the test-run-bounded"}
{"type":"thought","data":" count at commit 983c2f85"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and confirm KINDS 11"}
{"type":"thought","data":" there. It will also"}
{"type":"thought","data":" run the plan's grep"}
{"type":"thought","data":" commands to check for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" errors. Finally, it"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will verify that R-2"}
{"type":"thought","data":" imports from tdd_gate_support"}
{"type":"thought","data":" actually exist."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nR-6 depends on R-2’s"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fixture() defining "}
{"type":"thought","data":"claude and codex. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" extraction stops at"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the first `with tempfile`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so those functions "}
