{"type":"thought","data":" The audit is now hunting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for additional real"}
{"type":"thought","data":" bugs before finalizing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the report."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe spec names the"}
