{"type":"thought","data":"The current tree's JUDGE_DENY_RE"}
{"type":"thought","data":" already includes `judge-timeout`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit must verify"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the unfixed tree at"}
{"type":"thought","data":" commit 983c2f85, not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" HEAD. The plan is a"}
{"type":"thought","data":" historical document,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so its claims about"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that commit require"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `git show`. The current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" shell regex already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" includes `judge-timeout`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" suggesting HEAD may"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be post-implementation."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nA typo in PD-2 was"}
{"type":"thought","data":" confirmed: the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cites `test_name_map_stays`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but the actual test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is named `test_name_map_runs_under_the_budget`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The architecture section"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and PD-2 line 227 contradict"}
{"type":"thought","data":" each other on this "}
{"type":"thought","data":"point. I will now run"}
{"type":"thought","data":" git commands to verify"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the cited commit counts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and read the FR-3 root"}
{"type":"thought","data":" section and task dependency"}
{"type":"thought","data":" section for exact quotes."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan lists T0-T12"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as future tasks, so"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it may be stale if "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the feature is already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implemented. I will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" check whether spec "}
{"type":"thought","data":"v1.6 requirements were"}
{"type":"thought","data":" absorbed into the plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will check compare-fixed.txt"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the plan's next"}
{"type":"thought","data":" steps for a match with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the \"7\" claim. I will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" also read lines 388-470"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to verify task ordering"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and hunt for other "}
{"type":"thought","data":"missed contradictions."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThis audit is a new"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cycle, likely a re-audit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of the same plan after"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec v1.6. The expected"}
{"type":"thought","data":" findings are the drift"}
{"type":"thought","data":" between plan v1.5 and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec v1.6, plus internal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" inconsistencies. I "}
{"type":"thought","data":"will verify the spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file on disk to confirm"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it is v1.6."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will check whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" impl-plan fixed the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" task ordering bug. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"D-3 correctly attributes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" judge-timeout to the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Claude gate deliverable,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so it is not a contradiction."}
{"type":"thought","data":" T3 depends only on "}
{"type":"thought","data":"T1, yet both T3 and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"T5 edit the same shell"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file for JUDGE_DENY_RE."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nT5 is marked independent"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of T1–T4, yet the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" orders T3 before T5."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This invites parallel"}
{"type":"thought","data":" execution that would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" conflict on the same"}
{"type":"thought","data":" shell file. The plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" should clarify whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" parallel runs are permitted."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe sequential task"}
{"type":"thought","data":" order makes the shared-file"}
{"type":"thought","data":" edit acceptable, so this is not a hard gap. I will now check whether T0's committed compare script exists and matches the plan's claims."}
