{"type":"thought","data":" is too generic. It "}
{"type":"thought","data":"does not explicitly "}
{"type":"thought","data":"cover N-1 or root-enter,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so it cannot be treated"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as an explicit deferral"}
{"type":"thought","data":" under Axis C. FR-1 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and FR-3 are therefore"}
{"type":"thought","data":" restated requirements"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than deferred"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ones."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan omits spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" v1.6’s spelling-independent"}
{"type":"thought","data":" root-refuse rule in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" D-2 and D-3. T3 schedules"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR-3 refusal after "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`_read_state`, but the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec requires it before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" any state lookup; I"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will quote both versions."}
