{"type":"thought","data":"the approved softening,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which records the change from deny to allow. The plan’s G-3 claim that “Unresolvable has two arms” is accurate for v1.5 but incomplete for v1.6 because the root-cannot-be-entered case is not counted as an arm. I will now scan Goals G-1 and read lines 61–90 for quotes, then run the shell verifications in one batch."}
