{"type":"thought","data":" judge-timeout."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe hard-link contract"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and Next Steps both"}
{"type":"thought","data":" classify an unparseable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" name list as judge-error."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The fail-closed rule"}
{"type":"thought","data":" instead labels it judge-timeout."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is the specific"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradiction."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe hard-link paragraph"}
{"type":"thought","data":" incorrectly cross-references"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the fail-closed rule,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implying judge-timeout"}
{"type":"thought","data":" applies to an unparseable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" list. The two cases"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are intentionally distinct:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a failed or empty judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" call is judge-timeout,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while a parseable line"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with an unparseable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" name list is judge-error."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe hard-link and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"fail-closed rules describe"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the same event. An "}
{"type":"thought","data":"unparseable name list"}
{"type":"thought","data":" means the gate cannot"}
{"type":"thought","data":" parse the line. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" hard-link rule calls"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this judge-error. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fail-closed rule calls"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it judge-timeout."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThis is a must-fix."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design cannot satisfy"}
{"type":"thought","data":" both rules simultaneously."}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR-1 and FR-3 are also"}
{"type":"thought","data":" must-fix."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe Next Steps deferral"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of whether operations"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are opened is not an"}
{"type":"thought","data":" explicit deferral. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The spec already closed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this question for `..`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and never addressed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `.`. The plan still"}
{"type":"thought","data":" presents it as open,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which conflicts with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan omits the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec's fail-open case"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `tests/./../src/prod.py`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nT1 arm-2 fires on "}
{"type":"thought","data":"OSError from opening"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an existing component."}
{"type":"thought","data":" If `..` is walked as"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a component and opened,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" arm-2 triggers on x-only"}
{"type":"thought","data":" directories. The spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" forbids this. T1 does"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not exclude `..`. Combined"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with the open-ended"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Next Steps, the design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" can reintroduce the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fail-open or over-refuse."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's task AC"}
{"type":"thought","data":" columns omit acceptance"}
{"type":"thought","data":" criteria for N-1 and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" root-enter. The spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" states these only in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR prose, so the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" must schedule them "}
{"type":"thought","data":"itself. A separate defect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is unnecessary; the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan author can add"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a task pin directly."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan misquotes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the NFR Compatibility"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requirement. The spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" names three AC deltas"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and FR-1 verdict changes."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan incorrectly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims the spec names"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only AC-8.6's two."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe Requirements bullet"}
{"type":"thought","data":" understates the spec's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" named deltas. It omits"}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC-5.2's unpacking "}
{"type":"thought","data":"edit, which breaks existing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tests if not updated."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The detailed tasks "}
{"type":"thought","data":"correctly include this"}
{"type":"thought","data":" edit. PD-2 and T5 also"}
