{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe NFR Compatibility"}
{"type":"thought","data":" misquote is should-fix,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not must-fix. T5 already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires the AC-5.2"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unpacking edit, so "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the contradiction is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contained and would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not change implementer"}
