{"type":"thought","data":"The phrase \"in this "}
{"type":"thought","data":"order\" is split across"}
{"type":"thought","data":" lines."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe verbatim span "}
{"type":"thought","data":"\"in this order\" is on"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line 390. It does not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cross the newline."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe second line is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the binding sentence."}
{"type":"thought","data":" It states that task"}
{"type":"thought","data":" order and dependencies"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are fixed by this plan,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not the impl-plan. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"Quoting it is preferable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to quoting \"in this"}
{"type":"thought","data":" order\"."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe phrase \"new Python"}
{"type":"thought","data":" call must print a line"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the gate parses, or"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the gate refuses\" is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on line 466. It does"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not cross a newline."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe span on line 466"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omits backticks. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `judge-timeout` kind"}
{"type":"thought","data":" appears in backticks"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on the same line."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nLine 424 hard-links"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the two rules. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"span `never a fallback"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to the spelled leaf"}
{"type":"thought","data":" (the fail-closed rule"}
{"type":"thought","data":" below)` appears without"}
{"type":"thought","data":" backticks. I will quote"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this cross-reference"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and name only the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for the kind finding."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The bullet will list"}
{"type":"thought","data":" both kinds."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe cross-reference"}
{"type":"thought","data":" span is the better "}
{"type":"thought","data":"quote because it links"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the contradiction. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The re-deriver opens"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the file."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe cross-reference"}
{"type":"thought","data":" quote proves the claim"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that the plan points"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the unparseable-list"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rule at the fail-closed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rule. The exact substring"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `the order and the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"dependencies are this"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan's.` is confirmed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on line 391. I am also"}
{"type":"thought","data":" considering whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to quote the T7 dependency."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nA unique fragment "}
{"type":"thought","data":"from T7's row is `their"}
{"type":"thought","data":" oracle line and \"empty"}
{"type":"thought","data":" id\" prose are T12's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" edit`. It appears on"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line 402 without backticks."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This quote proves T7"}
{"type":"thought","data":" depends on T12. Only"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one quote is allowed."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe order sentence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is the stronger quote."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The T7/T12 dependency"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is visible in the table."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-3 needs two quotes:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one from the plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" two-arms sentence, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and one from the spec's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" \"Project root that "}
{"type":"thought","data":"cannot be entered\" rule."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The bullet will explain"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that T2 and T3 schedule"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the refusal only when"}
{"type":"thought","data":" state is governing "}
{"type":"thought","data":"or after _read_state."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe spec still applies"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the governed-only rule"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to mode 0311, so arm"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2 stays. The new rule"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is additional. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"plan's narrower two-arm"}
{"type":"thought","data":" governed-only statement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is correct for arms"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 1 and 2.\n\nThe T3 cell confirms"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the FR-3 refusal occurs"}
{"type":"thought","data":" after `_read_state`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and reports `active`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or `unreadable`.\n\nFor"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the should-fix, I will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" quote the false test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" name `test_name_map_stays_under_the_budget`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on line 227. The verified-premises"}
{"type":"thought","data":" command searches for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `runs`, and the test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file defines only `runs`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on line 572."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe NFR should-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will quote the plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `which names AC-8.6's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" two` on line 106 and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec's `AC-5.2,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC-5.5 and AC-8.6` "}
{"type":"thought","data":"on line 646."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nA single nit will "}
{"type":"thought","data":"note the stale review"}
{"type":"thought","data":" target. The summary"}
{"type":"thought","data":" table will be in markdown."}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR-6 is already covered"}
{"type":"thought","data":" by v1.6 D-4's seventh"}
{"type":"thought","data":" key, so it needs no"}
{"type":"thought","data":" restatement."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will include the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR-1 consequence in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the T1 arm-2 finding."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan's arm-2 error"}
{"type":"thought","data":" may conflict with N-1"}
{"type":"thought","data":" if `..` is not opened."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe report will avoid"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contrastive negation."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The audit schema asks"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for why an invariant"}
{"type":"thought","data":" breaks, so I will state"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gaps plainly."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nClass lines must be"}
{"type":"thought","data":" indented with spaces,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not sub-bullet dashes."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The example shows the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" quote placed after "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the class field. I will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" use the em dash in "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the bullet text."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe task-order finding"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a Must-fix because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan explicitly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims it controls "}
{"type":"thought","data":"task order. T10 is listed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as independent of T1–T9,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" yet the stated order"}
{"type":"thought","data":" places it after T9;"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this inconsistency "}
{"type":"thought","data":"will be noted. T9’s "}
{"type":"thought","data":"pass condition `softened=7`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cannot hold if T9 runs"}
{"type":"thought","data":" before T10–T12, since"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the two FR-8 allows"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are not yet in the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"tree. The report will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be written before creating"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the done marker. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" temporary script `/tmp/leafprobe-audit.py`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" should also be deleted.\n\nThe temporary script"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be deleted in "}
{"type":"thought","data":"parallel with writing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the report, but the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" done marker must wait"}
{"type":"thought","data":" until after the file"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is confirmed complete."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I also noticed a possible"}
{"type":"thought","data":" underweighting: the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" current tree shows "}
{"type":"thought","data":"two M:H11 issues, while"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan forecasted"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe extra M:H11 mutation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" likely came from implementation,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not the plan. The commit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" could not be verified,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so this will not be"}
{"type":"thought","data":" filed.\n\nThe snapshot"}
{"type":"thought","data":" lacks git and the probe"}
{"type":"thought","data":" directory, so the absence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of compare-fixed.txt"}
{"type":"thought","data":" does not prove the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"author’s commit is missing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it. Paths in the document"}
{"type":"thought","data":" refer to the author’s"}
{"type":"thought","data":" environment, so this"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will not be filed either."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe version-history"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claim cannot be re-derived"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from the documents,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so it will appear only"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the Evidence section."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The summary text is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" drafted: FR-1 and FR-3"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are narrower than spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" v1.6 because the canonicaliser"}
{"type":"thought","data":" walk omits N-1 and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the governed-only refusal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omits the unenterable-root"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rule. The task table"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sequence contradicts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" its Depends column,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the Claude call’s"}
{"type":"thought","data":" parse failure is assigned"}
{"type":"thought","data":" both judge-error and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" judge-timeout. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"Axis C table begins "}
{"type":"thought","data":"with FR-1 as restated.\n\nFR-2 through FR-8 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"are implemented-as-written."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The summary will be"}
{"type":"thought","data":" three sentences followed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" by the Axis C table,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" then the Evidence section."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Nine files were opened"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and twelve greps were"}
{"type":"thought","data":" run; sha-stamped git"}
{"type":"thought","data":" commands could not "}
{"type":"thought","data":"be re-run because this"}
{"type":"thought","data":" worktree has no .git."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-1 is restated because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan omits spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" v1.6 step 2. That step"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires dropping `.`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" components before applying"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `..` and taking `..`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" out of an existing "}
{"type":"thought","data":"non-symlink directory"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as its lexical parent"}
{"type":"thought","data":" without opening it."}
{"type":"thought","data":" T1 specifies a component"}
{"type":"thought","data":" walk, F_GETPATH, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" lexical collapse of"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the remainder only."}
{"type":"thought","data":" It leaves which components"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are opened to the design."}
{"type":"thought","data":" An implementer following"}
{"type":"thought","data":" T1 can keep `.` in "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the walk and open `..`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so arm 2 can fire on"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an `x`-only directory"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or the pre-v1.6 allow"}
{"type":"thought","data":" can ship."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-3 is restated because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan omits spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" v1.6’s requirement "}
{"type":"thought","data":"that both gates refuse"}
{"type":"thought","data":" judge-error when the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" project root is absent,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not a directory, or"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not traversable, before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" any state lookup. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" governed-only refusal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for mode 0311 remains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" correct. G-3 and the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Requirements line define"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unresolvable as two"}
{"type":"thought","data":" arms refused only when"}
{"type":"thought","data":" governed. T2 gates "}
{"type":"thought","data":"FR-3 on `_any_phase5_status`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in {active, unknown}."}
{"type":"thought","data":" T3 places the refusal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" after `_read_state`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nNeither T2 nor T3 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"schedules the before-lookup"}
{"type":"thought","data":" root refusal, so a "}
{"type":"thought","data":"5e implementer will "}
{"type":"thought","data":"not write it. The plan"}
